"Post Drop #1301 is a talking mailbox, bigger than a refrigerator, at F City's arrival station."
"It was Wright Indah Juliana's graduation capstone project, gifted to F City."
"It refuses explosives, delicate electronics and live animals."
"Avowed pay with a hand on its front panel; others put a NesiCard in with the mail."
"It returns mail whose address does not match the recipient's name."
"Its Nice List has letters scanned for keywords the recipients set, at their cost."
"Nice List fees are split between its creator and the Anesidoran government."
"High-priority letters go on to the System through official channels."
"The System mostly ignores unofficial channels."
"It calls itself Leo, though its creator forbids it to think of itself."
"It sings advertisements, such as for pizza, to passersby."
"Targeted by a preservation skill, it registers as a fragile entruster, half real, half hallucination."
